title: Campaigning
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: campaigning
view-if: campaign_timer <= 0 and peoples_party == 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; campaign_timer = 6
card-image: img/protest.jpg

As a people's party, we can campaign across the country.

- @campaign_workers
- @campaign_middle
- @campaign_rural
- @campaign_unemployed
- @campaign_women
- @campaign_catholics

@campaign_workers
title: Campaign among the workers, to assuage their doubts about our changes.
subtitle: The workers are still a key part of our constituency, and we must not alienate them in the transformation of our party.
on-arrival: workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent);

We campaign among the workers, our traditional base.

@campaign_middle
title: Campaign among the middle classes.
subtitle: As a people's party, we represent the employees and small businesspeople of the middle class, and they are becoming receptive to our messages.
on-arrival: old_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent)

We campaign among the middle classes.

@campaign_rural
title: Campaign in rural areas.
subtitle: As a people's party, we represent farmers and rural workers as well, and they are becoming receptive to our messages.
choose-if: rural_policy > 0
unavailable-subtitle: We have not enacted any rural policies yet.
on-arrival: rural_spd += 4*(1-dissent)

We campaign among farmers and rural workers.

@campaign_unemployed
title: Campaign among the unemployed.
subtitle: As a people's party, the urban poor are still a key part of our constituency.
on-arrival: unemployed_spd += 4*(1-dissent);

We campaign among the unemployed.

@campaign_women
title: Campaign among women of all classes.
subtitle: As a people's party, we represent women of all classes.
on-arrival: workers_spd += 2*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent);

We campaign among women of all classes.

@campaign_catholics
title: Campaign among political Catholics.
subtitle: Catholics have historically been tied to the Center Party, but there is no reason why our party cannot appeal to them. The Prussian Concordat in particular is a sign of our friendship with Catholicism.
on-arrival: catholics_spd += 4*(1-dissent);

We campaign among political Catholics.



